From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sapphire <sapphire@local>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] sapphire-0401: Replace all Sapphire branding with hakios

This patch replaces all visual assets and text references from "Sapphire" to "hakios":
- Boot splash screen (shim/splash.c, make_splash.py)
- Metal driver bundle name (HakiosMetal instead of SapphireMetal)
- Installer scripts and backgrounds
- Dual boot app icon and artwork
- Kernel log messages

---
